# The Night Lord's fourth class node and the branch's burst: explosive charms
# riding on the shurikens the character is already throwing.
#
# GMS's own figures: 475+19x% five times on six enemies per charm, one charm
# made every ten seconds for free, and 46 loaded at once by the active half, two
# to four used on every attack skill pressed, for 1000 MP on a 120s cooldown.
#
# ONE bank, filled two ways, as GMS states it: a charm is a charm, and the two
# halves differ only in how you get one. That is also all GMS's "the active and
# passive effects cannot trigger simultaneously" means: the timer that makes
# charms pauses while a load is in, and restarts once the burst's charges are
# gone.
#
# So the 60s limit never matters. Namu times the 46 running out in 14 to 17 Quad
# Star presses about 94% of the time, 8 to 11 seconds at that skill's 600ms; the
# duration is for a player who stops attacking.
#
# Three charms a press, GMS's two to four averaged. Over 46 that is 16 presses,
# inside the range namu measures.
#
# The charms are part of the character's own swing, not something on a timer, so
# Shadow Partner copies them and the Mark triggers on them. Namu says both
# outright: the real hit count is twice what is shown and the damage 1.7x, and
# 408,595% for a whole bank is the 240,350% below with the shadow included.
#
# Dropped: the 1000 MP, the throwing stars a charm uses, and immunity to attack
# reflection, none of which this game has.
name: "Throw Blasting"
description:
  "Throw shurikens with explosive charms attached. The charms explode after "
  "the shurikens hit, dealing additional attack to nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base_delay_ms: 960
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 60.0
  magazine {
    label: "Explosive Charm"
    charges: 46
    charges_per_swing: 3
    spent_by_every_swing: true
    recharge_seconds: 10.0
    recharge_max: 1
    max_enemies: 6
    lines: 5
    base { skill_pct: 4.94 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.19 }
  }
}
